{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この将棋の駒形のチョコは\n今年発売になって\n結構話題になっていたチョコです☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"戸辺先生に少し前の将棋世界の取材の時に\nいただきました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/02/17/5726699/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々忙しくさせていただいていて\nとってもありがたいです(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルを見に行けなかったのが\n本当に心残りです...(´,,•ω•,,｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3期生のみんなお疲れ様♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせしたいことが\nかなり溜まっている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが喜んでくれるお知らせが\nいくつもありますよ(*´-`)\nまだ言えないけど(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１つだけお知らせします～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第２回　江の島将棋頂上決戦"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.fujisawa-kanko.jp/message/tsuruno20170311.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふじさわ観光親善大使の\n「つるの剛士」さんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"対局させていただきます(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"師匠が同じ戸辺先生ということで\n同門対決でもあります(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3/11ぜひ遊びに来てください～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに詳しくは言えないけど\n3/5も良かったら\n予定空けておいてね(๑⁰ -⁰)！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"